 "frameSelect": "contract v1.2: frame = round(curl*(N-1)) = floor(curl*2+0.5) -> f0 (rest, identical to \"file\"), f1, f2. Frames carry \"childPivot\" (where the next segment attaches while that frame shows); \"pivot\" is never overridden (every frame is drawn from the rest pivot). No scaling: foreshortening is drawn into f1/f2.",
